{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragon Puncher</strong> is a single-player arcade-style action game designed to be a training tool for Street Fighter and 2D fighting game enthusiasts, and a well-rounded short game. About 15-20 minutes in length, players typically perform 50-75 dragon punch moves per play-through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026300/extras/68840f534bfb280bfb0abaac16ab6103.poster.avif?t=1769377249\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026300/extras/68840f534bfb280bfb0abaac16ab6103.webm?t=1769377249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026300/extras/68840f534bfb280bfb0abaac16ab6103.mp4?t=1769377249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Your Inner Fighter with Dragon Puncher!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-Style Action: Engage in fast-paced, single-player gameplay that captures the essence of classic arcade fighters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026300/extras/e8b170b1ad1dd9ee27a2c20effea843e.poster.avif?t=1769377249\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026300/extras/e8b170b1ad1dd9ee27a2c20effea843e.webm?t=1769377249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026300/extras/e8b170b1ad1dd9ee27a2c20effea843e.mp4?t=1769377249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"